{
  "title": "AbstractVector",
  "description": "Base class for all 2D vector types in ExoJS. Provides the full arithmetic, geometric, and transformation API shared by Vector, ObservableVector, and PolarVector-derived types. All mutating methods return `this` for chaining. Subclasses must implement `x`, `y`, and `destroy()`.",
