      "title": "Import",
      "members": [],
      "paragraphs": [
        "Base class for all 2D vector types in ExoJS. Provides the full arithmetic, geometric, and transformation API shared by Vector, ObservableVector, and PolarVector-derived types.",
        "All mutating methods return `this` for chaining. Subclasses must implement `x`, `y`, and `destroy()`."
      ],
      "importLine": "import { AbstractVector } from '@codexo/exojs'",
      "sourceLink": null
